{
  "$comment": "Shared pre-image contract fixture. REGENERATE with `bun run gen:preimage-vectors` from aleph-cloud/; never hand-edit a digest or a verdict. `vectors` binds a pre-image payload to a digest from aleph-cloud/packages/engineering/src/spatial/fingerprint.ts (the design-guard digest) — the plugin port aleph-desktop/integrations/autocad/plugin/Edits/PreImageCanonical.cs must reproduce it byte for byte, because Cloud stores only the digest while the payload stays on the user machine and the restore path re-computes it inside AutoCAD. `createVectors` is one table asserted by BOTH the C# Restorability.IsRoundTripPayload theory and the TypeScript zod createEntityParams parse. `restorabilityVectors` is the verdict table and `restorabilityWireShape`/`entityPreImageWireShape` the serialized field names, pinned by the C# RestorabilityTests against the plugin types and by apps/mcp-autocad/src/tools/edit.test.ts against the Restorability/EntityPreImage interfaces in wire-protocol/local-ipc/methods.ts.",
